  (i)  the first differing call differs in its INPUT (a tool result -- e.g. a pytest timing line or a listing order)
       while every earlier call is identical -> the split enters through the ENVIRONMENT; the loop is deterministic
       given its inputs; remedy candidates are at the tool-output layer (normalising volatile fields), pre-registered
       separately before any is shipped.
